      "text": "Ocean covers 71% of Earth's surface. Average depth: 3,688 m. Volume: ~1.335 billion km³.\nThe ocean is not just a habitat — it is the largest, most structurally complex biosphere on\nEarth, and the one we understand least. Most of it has never been directly observed."
    },
