      "text": "| Metric | Value | Context |\n|--------|-------|---------|\n| Ocean area | 361 million km² | 71% of Earth's surface |\n| Ocean volume | 1.335 billion km³ | 97% of Earth's liquid water |\n| Mean depth | 3,688 m | Deepest point: 10,935 m |\n| Species described | ~250,000 | Estimated total: 700,000–1,000,000 |\n| O₂ from ocean | ~50% of Earth's | Phytoplankton photosynthesis |\n| Net marine primary production | ~50 Pg C/year | 46% of global total |\n| Blue whale (largest animal) | 29.9 m, 173 tonnes | Largest in Earth's history |\n| Bacteria in top 200 m | ~10²⁸ cells | More than stars in observable universe |"
