      "text": "```\n                         MARINE BIOLOGY\n                              │\n          ┌───────────────────┼────────────────────┐\n          │                   │                    │\n          ▼                   ▼                    ▼\n   OCEANOGRAPHY         EVOLUTIONARY          CLIMATE SCIENCE\n   Physical/chemical    BIOLOGY               Ocean as CO₂ sink\n   ocean properties:    Cetacean return-      Biological pump\n   temperature,         to-sea,               Acidification,\n   salinity, currents,  convergent            species range\n   pressure             evolution,            shifts\n                        island biogeography\n          │                   │\n          ▼                   ▼\n   ECOLOGY               ASTROBIOLOGY\n   Trophic dynamics,     Chemosynthetic\n   keystone species,     ecosystems as\n   community succession, models for\n   MPAs                  Europa/Enceladus\n```"
